  "solution": "Giả sử trường học thuê <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>x</mi></semantics></math> xe loại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>y</mi></semantics></math> xe loại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math>.<br>Số người có thể chở là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (người).<br>Số hàng có thể chở là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (tấn).<br>Theo giả thiết ta có hệ bất phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mn>30</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>180</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>8</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>10</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>9</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>18</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>10</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>10</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></semantics></math><br>Biểu diễn miền nghiệm của hệ bất phương trình\n\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/fc5558a26464770a5ddc884e821daf905fe74e8a57eb63958f1d35f4fa209f16.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tMiền nghiệm của hệ bất phương trình là tứ giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>;</mo>